|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | 1 | 0 | 0 | 0 | 0 |

## Overall Score: **5 / 100**

## Verdict: **FAIL**

This code contains a textbook SQL injection vulnerability — the single most dangerous and commonly exploited class of web application flaw. The user-supplied `req.query.id` value flows directly into a SQL query string via concatenation on line 4 with zero mitigation. This must be fixed with parameterized queries before this code is deployed in any environment.
