  const limit = Math.min(parseInt(req.query.limit) || 50, 200);
  const offset = parseInt(req.query.offset) || 0;
  const result = await pool.query(
    'SELECT id, action, actor_id, created_at FROM audit_logs ORDER BY created_at DESC LIMIT $1 OFFSET $2',
    [limit, offset]
  );
  res.json(result.rows);
});
```

For very large tables, cursor-based (keyset) pagination avoids the increasing cost of large `OFFSET` values.

