**Recommendation**: Use a Unicode-aware counting method:

```typescript
function validateUsername(name: string): boolean {
  // Count Unicode code points (handles surrogate pairs)
  const codePointLength = [...name].length;
  // Or for true grapheme cluster counting:
  // const graphemeLength = new Intl.Segmenter('en', { granularity: 'grapheme' }).segment(name);
  // const graphemeCount = [...graphemeLength].length;
