### CYBER-001: XML External Entity (XXE) Injection

| Field | Detail |
|---|---|
| **Rule ID** | CYBER-001 |
| **Severity** | **Critical** |
| **CWE** | CWE-611: Improper Restriction of XML External Entity Reference |
| **OWASP** | A05:2021 – Security Misconfiguration |
| **Confidence** | 99% |

**Description:**

The `parse` method at **line 7-12** creates a `DocumentBuilderFactory` with **default configuration**, which in most Java implementations enables processing of external entities and DTDs. The user-controlled `String xmlInput` parameter is passed directly to `builder.parse()` at **line 11** without any XXE protections on the factory.

Specifically, the factory created at **line 8** is missing all of the following critical hardening features before `newDocumentBuilder()` is called at **line 10**:

- `XMLConstants.FEATURE_SECURE_PROCESSING` is not enabled
- External general entities are not disabled
- External parameter entities are not disabled
- DTD processing is not disabled

**Exploit Scenario:**

An attacker can supply the following payload as `xmlInput` to read arbitrary files from the server:

```xml
<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE foo [
  <!ENTITY xxe SYSTEM "file:///etc/passwd">
]>
<root>&xxe;</root>
```

More dangerous variants include:
- **SSRF**: `<!ENTITY xxe SYSTEM "http://internal-service:8080/admin">` to probe internal networks
- **Denial of Service (Billion Laughs)**: Exponentially expanding entity definitions to exhaust memory

**Remediation:**

```java
import javax.xml.XMLConstants;
import javax.xml.parsers.*;
import org.w3c.dom.Document;
import org.xml.sax.InputSource;
import java.io.*;

public class XmlProcessor {
    public Document parse(String xmlInput) throws Exception {
        DocumentBuilderFactory factory = DocumentBuilderFactory.newInstance();

        // Disable DTDs entirely (most effective single defense)
        factory.setFeature("http://apache.org/xml/features/disallow-doctype-decl", true);

        // Defense-in-depth: disable external entities even if DTD somehow processed
        factory.setFeature("http://xml.org/sax/features/external-general-entities", false);
        factory.setFeature("http://xml.org/sax/features/external-parameter-entities", false);
        factory.setFeature(XMLConstants.FEATURE_SECURE_PROCESSING, true);

        // Prevent external DTD loading
        factory.setAttribute(XMLConstants.ACCESS_EXTERNAL_DTD, "");
        factory.setAttribute(XMLConstants.ACCESS_EXTERNAL_SCHEMA, "");

        DocumentBuilder builder = factory.newDocumentBuilder();
        return builder.parse(new InputSource(new StringReader(xmlInput)));
    }
}
```

