### CYBER-001: Reflected Origin CORS with Credentials Enables Cross-Site Data Theft

| Field | Value |
|-------|-------|
| **Rule ID** | CYBER-001 |
| **Severity** | **Critical** |
| **CWE** | CWE-942 (Overly Permissive Cross-domain Whitelist) |
